WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.446
(Here we go now) It's time to fly!

00:04.446 --> 00:09.647
We've waited so long, let's touch the sky!

00:09.647 --> 00:12.437
Are you ready for the best weekend ever?

00:12.437 --> 00:15.261
Yeah, let's keep this energy together!

00:15.261 --> 00:16.899
It’s been a long time since we’ve gotten together,

00:16.899 --> 00:19.058
